  "description": "A zero-dependency, pure .NET charting library for Blazor. Renders Line, Bar, Donut, Pie, World Map, Bar List, Sparkline, Commit Graph, Calendar Heatmap, Sankey, and Matrix charts as SVG via Razor components — no JavaScript, no interop, no external dependencies. Includes built-in light/dark theming, hover tooltips, and accessible SVG output.",
